  "description": "Hanna, a chef of a famous restaurant in London was a victim of terror bombings. When she woke up, she became Choi Songyi, the daughter of the Minister of War Affairs of the Joseon Kingdom.\n\nThe Crown Prince of the Joseon kingdom, Lee Pyo has a extraordinary talent. His sense of smell and taste are very sensitive; he has never forgotten the taste and aroma of any food he's ever eaten.\n\nWhat will happen if both of them meet?\n\n**Original Webtoon**                               \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/home?seriesId=52030237)  \n\n**Official Translations**                                \n[Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/20409), [Indonesian](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/Makan-Tanpa-Ragu/314)",
